  m_text: "I began to write down everything I see in our family.\nGrandfather had
    only dark spots on his hands.\nFather already had spots and a torn lip. I have
    spots, a torn lip, and a crooked skull.\nWith each new generation, our deformities
    increase, and the old ones grow worse. \nI thought \u2014 a curse. Passed through
    blood. But why does it get stronger? And why has no priest helped us?\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
